cSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">火山引擎发布豆包大模型 2.1 Pro 0915 版本，强化 Agent 交付与多模态 Coding 能力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare上线Disallow AI Training设置，支持拒绝AI训练并保留搜索爬取</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 发布 Claude 中小企业版重大升级，集成 27 个应用与 43 项工作流</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里千问 Qwen3.8-27B 登顶 Hugging Face 成为史上最受欢迎开源模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月16日，阿里千问旗下开源大模型 Qwen3.8-27B 在 Hugging Face 平台正式登顶，成为该平台历史上最受欢迎（Most likes）的开源模型。此次排名基于开发者社区的真实点赞数据，而非传统的基准测试跑分或参数规模。Qwen3.8-27B 在竞争中超越了 FLUX.1、DeepSeek-R1、Kimi-K3 以及 Meta-Llama-3 等行业头部模型。这一成绩标志着 Qwen3.8-27B 在实用性、易用性及社区口碑方面获得了开发者的高度认可，反映出其在开源生态中已具备极强的竞争优势与用户粘性，成为当前开源大模型领域的重要标杆。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布多语言AI新战略，Gemini 3.5支持超300种语言并推进千种语言计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9f9887da5263e924469d0516a820aeec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近日发布全球语言智能战略，宣布其AI技术已支持超300种语言，覆盖全球86%人口。核心技术升级包括从多步管线转向原生音频智能，使Gemini 3.5 Live Translate实现70种语言实时口语翻译，并能捕捉情感线索。Gemini 3.5 Transcribe则赋能Gboard实现高精度语音转写与跨语种切换。为覆盖低资源语种，谷歌推进“1,000种语言计划”，利用通用语音模型（USM）及WAXAL、Project Vaani等开源数据集进行训练。针对离线场景，谷歌推出TranslateGemma轻量级模型，支持55种语言在端侧高效运行。此外，谷歌还发布了基于50多种手语训练的SL2T技术，并深度整合至搜索、安卓等九大核心平台。该战略旨在通过技术手段打破语言壁垒，在尊重文化多样性的前提下，提升全球用户在</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">火山引擎发布豆包大模型 2.1 Pro 0915 版本，强化 Agent 交付与多模态 Coding 能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/38c13e061176179fc3f13e045d546db2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月16日，火山引擎正式发布豆包大模型 2.1 Pro 0915 版本，该模型 API 已全量上线火山方舟，豆包客户端、TRAE 及 Doubao-Seed-Evolving 同步完成升级。新版本在 Agent 任务交付上强化了证据溯源与数据核验，显著降低模型幻觉，提升了金融投研等场景的分析稳健性。在多模态 Coding 层面，模型增强了跨文件工程理解能力，并利用 VLM 技术实现设计稿至代码的转换。视频推理能力实现跨帧信息整合，支持 SOP 对照与专业领域操作解析。此外，图像理解在 3D 物体识别、工程图纸及复杂表格提取方面精度提升。得益于 Token 效率优化，图像与视频推理的 Token 消耗较上一代降低 30% 以上，有效降低了高频业务场景的推理成本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare上线Disallow AI Training设置，支持拒绝AI训练并保留搜索爬取</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c42ba4933e6f6859ed739365f587a783.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cloudflare正式推出“Disallow AI Training”新设置，旨在帮助网站管理员在允许搜索引擎抓取内容的同时，精准拦截用于AI模型训练的爬虫。该功能通过识别“Accountable”（可问责）爬虫实现差异化管理，目前苹果、谷歌及微软已承诺遵守此设置。对于此前已在Training选项中选择“Block”或“Block on pages with ads”的存量客户，系统将自动迁移至该新设置。官方提醒，拦截AI训练爬虫可能对网站搜索排名产生潜在影响。此外，谷歌计划在未来几周推出Google-Extended URL层级透明度工具，苹果正开发同类工具，微软则预计于2027年初通过robots.txt协议支持拒绝AI训练。此举为网站内容所有者提供了更细粒度的版权与数据控制权，平衡了SEO流量获取与AI</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 发布 Claude 中小企业版重大升级，集成 27 个应用与 43 项工作流</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 于 2026 年 9 月 15 日宣布升级中小企业版 Claude，新增 43 项高效工作流及 27 个主流商业软件深度集成。此次更新重点覆盖 Shopify、Salesforce、TikTok、Atlassian、Zoom、Stripe 等平台，构建起涵盖财务、营销、客服与运营的完整生态矩阵。核心功能包括“每周简报”、“线索智能响应”、“智能提案生成”、“营销内容引擎”及“月末对账与结账”，旨在解决业务拓展与日常管理痛点。在安全治理方面，系统默认采用“人工审批”模式，并承诺不使用商业数据进行模型训练，严格继承企业原有权限。为降低技术门槛，Anthropic 同步启动秋季巡回培训计划，将通过线下工作坊与线上直播课程，助力中小企业实现数字化转型。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
